        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Oliver Cooper, Tom Kapinos\n- Works: Project X, Californication\n- Topics: acting careers, television series\n\nFacts:\n- Californication is an American comedy-drama television series created by Tom Kapinos that aired on Showtime for seven seasons from August 13, 2007, to June 29, 2014.\n- Oliver Cooper began his acting career in short films in 2010.\n- Oliver Cooper is best known for playing Costa in the 2012 comedy film Project X.\n- Oliver Cooper is also known for playing Levon on the comedy-drama series Californication.",
